rl( '/services/ai-pet-training/behavior-correction/' ) ); ?>">Behavior Correction</a></li><li><a class="hover:text-accent" href="<?php echo esc_url( home_url( '/services/ai-pet-training/obedience-programs/' ) ); ?>">Obedience Programs</a></li></ul><a class="mt-6 inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-sm font-semibold text-accent" href="<?php echo esc_url( home_url( '/services/ai-pet-training/' ) ); ?>">Explore AI Pet Training<span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></div><div class="rounded-3xl border border-border bg-card p-7 shadow-soft transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1 hover:shadow-lift"><p class="font-display text-sm text-accent">04</p><h3 class="mt-3 text-2xl"><a class="hover:text-accent" href="<?php echo esc_url( home_url( '/services/smart-pet-care/' ) ); ?>">Smart Pet Care</a></h3><p class="mt-3 leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">Connected feeding, hydration, climate and daily-care automation.</p><ul class="mt-5 space-y-1.5 text-sm text-muted-foreground"><li><a class="hover:text-accent" href="<?php echo esc_url( home_url( '/services/smart-pet-care/smart-feeding-systems/' ) ); ?>">Smart Feeding Systems</a></li><li><a class="hover:text-accent" href="<?php echo esc_url( home_url( '/services/smart-pet-care/hydration-monitoring/' ) ); ?>">Hydration Monitoring</a></li><li><a class="hover:text-accent" href="<?php echo esc_url( home_url( '/services/smart-pet-care/automated-care/' ) ); ?>">Automated Care</a></li></ul><a class="mt-6 inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-sm font-semibold text-accent" href="<?php echo esc_url( home_url( '/services/smart-pet-care/' ) ); ?>">Explore Smart Pet Care<span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></div><div class="rounded-3xl border border-border bg-card p-7 shadow-soft transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1 hover:shadow-lift"><p class="font-display text-sm text-accent">05</p><h3 class="mt-3 text-2xl"><a class="hover:text-accent" href="<?php echo esc_url( home_url( '/services/ai-pet-safety/' ) ); ?>">AI Pet Safety</a></h3><p class="mt-3 leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">Location intelligence, escape prevention and emergency response.</p><ul class="mt-5 space-y-1.5 text-sm text-muted-foreground"><li><a class="hover:text-accent" href="<?php echo esc_url( home_url( '/services/ai-pet-safety/gps-tracking/' ) ); ?>">GPS Tracking</a></li><li><a class="hover:text-accent" href="<?php echo esc_url( home_url( '/services/ai-pet-safety/escape-prevention/' ) ); ?>">Escape Prevention</a></li><li><a class="hover:text-accent" href="<?php echo esc_url( home_url( '/services/ai-pet-safety/emergency-alerts/' ) ); ?>">Emergency Alerts</a></li></ul><a class="mt-6 inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-sm font-semibold text-accent" href="<?php echo esc_url( home_url( '/services/ai-pet-safety/' ) ); ?>">Explore AI Pet Safety<span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></div></div></div></section><section class="py-20 sm:py-24 bg-primary text-primary-foreground"><div class="container-page"><div class="grid gap-14 lg:grid-cols-2 lg:items-center"><div><p class="mb-4 inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-accent"><span aria-hidden="true" class="h-px w-6 bg-accent"></span>The technology</p><h2 class="text-3xl leading-tight sm:text-4xl">Intelligence that earns the right to interrupt you</h2><p class="mt-5 text-lg leading-relaxed text-primary-foreground/75">Most pet technology optimises for engagement: notifications, scores, streaks. We optimise for clinical usefulness, which usually means saying nothing at all.</p><dl class="mt-10 space-y-7"><div class="border-l-2 border-accent/60 pl-5"><dt class="font-display text-xl">Sensor fusion</dt><dd class="mt-2 leading-relaxed text-primary-foreground/70">Cardiac, respiratory, inertial, acoustic and environmental streams are read together. A single elevated heart rate means little; the same reading alongside disturbed sleep and reduced appetite means a great deal.</dd></div><div class="border-l-2 border-accent/60 pl-5"><dt class="font-display text-xl">Per-animal baselines</dt><dd class="mt-2 leading-relaxed text-primary-foreground/70">Fourteen days of ordinary life build a physiological fingerprint unique to your animal. Every subsequent reading is scored against that, never against a breed average.</dd></div><div class="border-l-2 border-accent/60 pl-5"><dt class="font-display text-xl">Anomaly modelling</dt><dd class="mt-2 leading-relaxed text-primary-foreground/70">Statistical deviation detection tuned for sensitivity to sustained trends rather than momentary spikes. Fewer alerts, and the ones you get are worth reading.</dd></div><div class="border-l-2 border-accent/60 pl-5"><dt class="font-display text-xl">On-device intelligence</dt><dd class="mt-2 leading-relaxed text-primary-foreground/70">Acoustic classification runs on the sensor itself. Audio never leaves your home, which is an architectural decision, not a settings toggle.</dd></div></dl></div><img alt="PawlogicTech environmental room sensor resting on pale sage textile" class="w-full rounded-3xl object-cover shadow-lift" decoding="async" height="900" loading="lazy" src="<?php echo esc_url( get_template_directory_uri() ); ?>/assets/images/tech-sensor.webp" width="1200"/></div></div></section><section class="py-20 sm:py-24"><div class="container-page"><div class="max-w-2xl"><p class="mb-4 inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-accent"><span aria-hidden="true" class="h-px w-6 bg-accent"></span>How it works</p><h2 class="text-3xl leading-tight sm:text-4xl">From unboxing to a vet-ready record in four steps</h2><p class="mt-4 text-lg leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">Setup takes under thirty minutes. Everything after that happens without you thinking about it.</p></div><ol class="mt-12 grid gap-6 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4"><li class="rounded-3xl border border-border bg-card p-7"><span class="font-display text-3xl text-sage">01</span><h3 class="mt-4 text-xl">Fit and pair</h3><p class="mt-2 leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">Attach the collar module and place your room sensors. Pairing is guided and takes minutes.</p></li><li class="rounded-3xl border border-border bg-card p-7"><span class="font-display text-3xl text-sage">02</span><h3 class="mt-4 text-xl">Learn the baseline</h3><p class="mt-2 leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">Fourteen days of ordinary life build your animal's individual physiological fingerprint.</p></li><li class="rounded-3xl border border-border bg-card p-7"><span class="font-display text-3xl text-sage">03</span><h3 class="mt-4 text-xl">Monitor continuously</h3><p class="mt-2 leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">Health, behaviour, intake and location stream into one record and are scored against baseline.</p></li><li class="rounded-3xl border border-border bg-card p-7"><span class="font-display text-3xl text-sage">04</span><h3 class="mt-4 text-xl">Act with evidence</h3><p class="mt-2 leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">Graded alerts arrive with a recommended action and a report your veterinarian can use.</p></li></ol></div></section><section class="py-20 sm:py-24 bg-card"><div class="container-page"><div class="max-w-2xl"><p class="mb-4 inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-accent"><span aria-hidden="true" class="h-px w-6 bg-accent"></span>Why PawlogicTech</p><h2 class="text-3xl leading-tight sm:text-4xl">Six commitments we will not trade away</h2><p class="mt-4 text-lg leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">These are the decisions that make the product harder to build and better to live with.</p></div><div class="mt-12 grid gap-6 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3"><div class="rounded-3xl border border-border bg-card p-7 shadow-soft transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1 hover:shadow-lift"><h3 class="text-xl">Veterinary-governed</h3><p class="mt-3 leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">Every alert threshold is reviewed by our veterinary advisory panel before it ships. Nothing is tuned purely for engagement.</p></div><div class="rounded-3xl border border-border bg-card p-7 shadow-soft transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1 hover:shadow-lift"><h3 class="text-xl">Individual baselines</h3><p class="mt-3 leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">We compare your animal to itself, not to a breed average. That is the difference between a useful alert and a false alarm.</p></div><div class="rounded-3xl border border-border bg-card p-7 shadow-soft transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1 hover:shadow-lift"><h3 class="text-xl">Privacy without compromise</h3><p class="mt-3 leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">Audio is classified on-device. Data is encrypted end to end and never sold to insurers, brokers or advertisers.</p></div><div class="rounded-3xl border border-border bg-card p-7 shadow-soft transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1 hover:shadow-lift"><h3 class="text-xl">Reward-based only</h3><p class="mt-3 leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">We refuse to build, sell or integrate with aversive correction hardware. Our training platform is positive reinforcement, always.</p></div><div class="rounded-3xl border border-border bg-card p-7 shadow-soft transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1 hover:shadow-lift"><h3 class="text-xl">One connected record</h3><p class="mt-3 leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">Health, behaviour, nutrition and safety in a single record, because correlation is where the insight lives.</p></div><div class="rounded-3xl border border-border bg-card p-7 shadow-soft transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1 hover:shadow-lift"><h3 class="text-xl">Built to be handed over</h3><p class="mt-3 leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">Everything exports. Your data belongs to you and follows your animal across clinics and countries.</p></div></div></div></section><section class="py-20 sm:py-24 bg-secondary"><div class="container-page"><div class="grid gap-12 lg:grid-cols-[1fr_1fr] lg:items-center"><img alt="Veterinarian reviewing a PawlogicTech pet health report on a tablet in a clinic" class="w-full rounded-3xl object-cover shadow-lift" decoding="async" height="900" loading="lazy" src="<?php echo esc_url( get_template_directory_uri() ); ?>/assets/images/vet-review.webp" width="1200"/><div><div class="max-w-2xl"><p class="mb-4 inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-accent"><span aria-hidden="true" class="h-px w-6 bg-accent"></span>The benefits</p><h2 class="text-3xl leading-tight sm:text-4xl">What changes when care becomes measurable</h2></div><dl class="mt-8 space-y-6"><div><dt class="font-display text-xl">Earlier intervention</dt><dd class="mt-1.5 leading-relaxed text-sage-foreground/80">Trend alerts typically surface change nine to twenty-one days before an owner reports a visible symptom.</dd></div><div><dt class="font-display text-xl">Lower lifetime cost</dt><dd class="mt-1.5 leading-relaxed text-sage-foreground/80">Conditions caught early are cheaper to manage and far less likely to become chronic emergencies.</dd></div><div><dt class="font-display text-xl">Shorter, sharper consults</dt><dd class="mt-1.5 leading-relaxed text-sage-foreground/80">Your vet starts from ninety days of objective evidence instead of a recollection of last Tuesday.</dd></div><div><dt class="font-display text-xl">Genuine peace of mind</dt><dd class="mt-1.5 leading-relaxed text-sage-foreground/80">Not because nothing can go wrong, but because you will know about it while it still matters.</dd></div></dl></div></div></div></section><section class="py-20 sm:py-24"><div class="container-page"><div class="max-w-2xl"><p class="mb-4 inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-accent"><span aria-hidden="true" class="h-px w-6 bg-accent"></span>Who we serve</p><h2 class="text-3xl leading-tight sm:text-4xl">Built for households, trusted by professionals</h2><p class="mt-4 text-lg lea