warning lead time</p></div><div><p class="font-display text-4xl text-accent sm:text-5xl">42</p><p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-primary-foreground/70">Veterinary partner practices</p></div><div><p class="font-display text-4xl text-accent sm:text-5xl">99.95%</p><p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-primary-foreground/70">Platform uptime, trailing 12 months</p></div></div></div></section><section class="py-20 sm:py-24 bg-card"><div class="container-page"><div class="max-w-2xl"><p class="mb-4 inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-accent"><span aria-hidden="true" class="h-px w-6 bg-accent"></span>Client stories</p><h2 class="text-3xl leading-tight sm:text-4xl">Owners, clinicians and facilities using the platform daily</h2></div><div class="mt-12 grid gap-6 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3"><figure class="flex h-full flex-col rounded-3xl border border-border bg-background p-7"><blockquote class="flex-1 text-lg leading-relaxed">“The resting heart rate trend flagged a change three weeks before Bruno showed any symptom. Our vet found early mitral valve disease. Three weeks earlier means a completely different management plan.”</blockquote><figcaption class="mt-6 border-t border-border pt-5 text-sm"><span class="block font-semibold">Helena Marsh</span><span class="block text-muted-foreground">Owner of Bruno, 9-year-old Cavalier King Charles Spaniel</span><span class="block text-muted-foreground">Bristol, UK</span></figcaption></figure><figure class="flex h-full flex-col rounded-3xl border border-border bg-background p-7"><blockquote class="flex-1 text-lg leading-relaxed">“We fit the monitoring platform across our boarding kennels last year. Being able to show an owner objective evidence that their dog slept well and ate normally has removed almost every difficult conversation we used to have.”</blockquote><figcaption class="mt-6 border-t border-border pt-5 text-sm"><span class="block font-semibold">Daniel Okonjo</span><span class="block text-muted-foreground">Director, Fernbank Boarding &amp; Daycare</span><span class="block text-muted-foreground">Manchester, UK</span></figcaption></figure><figure class="flex h-full flex-col rounded-3xl border border-border bg-background p-7"><blockquote class="flex-1 text-lg leading-relaxed">“I was sceptical about behavioural AI. What convinced me was the trigger correlation. It identified that my dog's reactivity clustered around bin collection days, which I would never have connected on my own.”</blockquote><figcaption class="mt-6 border-t border-border pt-5 text-sm"><span class="block font-semibold">Priya Raman</span><span class="block text-muted-foreground">Owner of Sunny, 4-year-old rescue crossbreed</span><span class="block text-muted-foreground">Leeds, UK</span></figcaption></figure></div><a class="mt-10 inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-sm font-semibold text-accent" href="<?php echo esc_url( home_url( '/testimonials/' ) ); ?>">Read every client story <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></div></section><section class="py-20 sm:py-24"><div class="container-page"><div class="max-w-2xl"><p class="mb-4 inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-accent"><span aria-hidden="true" class="h-px w-6 bg-accent"></span>From the journal</p><h2 class="text-3xl leading-tight sm:text-4xl">Practical, evidence-led writing on pet care</h2><p class="mt-4 text-lg leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">Written by our veterinary and behavioural team. No affiliate links, no filler.</p></div><div class="mt-12 grid gap-8 md:grid-cols-3"><article class="group flex flex-col"><a class="overflow-hidden rounded-2xl" href="<?php echo esc_url( home_url( '/blog/early-signs-of-illness-in-dogs/' ) ); ?>"><img alt="Golden retriever wearing a smart health monitoring collar at home" class="aspect-[16/10] w-full object-cover transition-transform duration-500 group-hover:scale-105" decoding="async" height="1600" loading="lazy" src="<?php echo esc_url( get_template_directory_uri() ); ?>/assets/images/hero-dog.webp" width="1280"/></a><p class="mt-5 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-accent">Pet Health · 8 min read</p><h3 class="mt-3 text-2xl leading-snug"><a class="hover:text-accent" href="<?php echo esc_url( home_url( '/blog/early-signs-of-illness-in-dogs/' ) ); ?>">The Early Signs of Illness in Dogs Most Owners Miss</a></h3><p class="mt-3 leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">By the time a dog looks unwell, the condition has usually been developing for weeks. These are the eight signals that appear first, and why almost nobody notices them.</p></article><article class="group flex flex-col"><a class="overflow-hidden rounded-2xl" href="<?php echo esc_url( home_url( '/blog/how-ai-detects-pet-anxiety/' ) ); ?>"><img alt="Tabby cat resting beside a discreet smart home sensor" class="aspect-[16/10] w-full object-cover transition-transform duration-500 group-hover:scale-105" decoding="async" height="900" loading="lazy" src="<?php echo esc_url( get_template_directory_uri() ); ?>/assets/images/cat-monitoring.webp" width="1200"/></a><p class="mt-5 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-accent">Behaviour · 7 min read</p><h3 class="mt-3 text-2xl leading-snug"><a class="hover:text-accent" href="<?php echo esc_url( home_url( '/blog/how-ai-detects-pet-anxiety/' ) ); ?>">How AI Detects Pet Anxiety Before You Do</a></h3><p class="mt-3 leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">The behaviour you most need to understand happens when nobody is home. Measurement solves a problem that observation structurally cannot.</p></article><article class="group flex flex-col"><a class="overflow-hidden rounded-2xl" href="<?php echo esc_url( home_url( '/blog/smart-feeding-and-pet-obesity/' ) ); ?>"><img alt="Minimalist smart pet sensor device on a pale sage textile surface" class="aspect-[16/10] w-full object-cover transition-transform duration-500 group-hover:scale-105" decoding="async" height="900" loading="lazy" src="<?php echo esc_url( get_template_directory_uri() ); ?>/assets/images/tech-sensor.webp" width="1200"/></a><p class="mt-5 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-accent">Nutrition · 6 min read</p><h3 class="mt-3 text-2xl leading-snug"><a class="hover:text-accent" href="<?php echo esc_url( home_url( '/blog/smart-feeding-and-pet-obesity/' ) ); ?>">Smart Feeding and the Pet Obesity Problem</a></h3><p class="mt-3 leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">Nobody intends to overfeed. Portion drift is a measurement failure, not a discipline failure, and measurement is the thing that fixes it.</p></article></div></div></section><section class="py-20 sm:py-24 bg-card"><div class="container-page"><div class="grid gap-12 lg:grid-cols-[0.8fr_1.2fr]"><div class="max-w-2xl"><p class="mb-4 inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-accent"><span aria-hidden="true" class="h-px w-6 bg-accent"></span>Questions</p><h2 class="text-3xl leading-tight sm:text-4xl">The things people ask us first</h2><p class="mt-4 text-lg leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">If your question is not here, our full FAQ goes considerably deeper.</p></div><div><div class="divide-y divide-border rounded-3xl border border-border bg-card"><details class="group px-6 py-5"><summary class="flex cursor-pointer list-none items-start justify-between gap-6 text-left font-display text-lg">What exactly does PawlogicTech do?<span aria-hidden="true" class="mt-1 shrink-0 text-accent transition-transform duration-200 group-open:rotate-45"><svg class="h-5 w-5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" viewbox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 5v14M5 12h14"></path></svg></span></summary><p class="mt-3 max-w-3xl leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">We build AI-driven pet care systems across five areas: health monitoring, behaviour analysis, training, smart daily care and safety. Sensors gather objective data about your animal, our models compare it against that animal's own baseline, and you receive clear, graded guidance about what needs attention.</p></details><details class="group px-6 py-5"><summary class="flex cursor-pointer list-none items-start justify-between gap-6 text-left font-display text-lg">Is this a replacement for veterinary care?<span aria-hidden="true" class="mt-1 shrink-0 text-accent transition-transform duration-200 group-open:rotate-45"><svg class="h-5 w-5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" viewbox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 5v14M5 12h14"></path></svg></span></summary><p class="mt-3 max-w-3xl leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">No. PawlogicTech is a monitoring, triage and management platform. It surfaces evidence earlier and structures it for clinical review, but diagnosis and treatment are always the responsibility of a qualified veterinary professional.</p></details><details class="group px-6 py-5"><summary class="flex cursor-pointer list-none items-start justify-between gap-6 text-left font-display text-lg">Which animals are supported?<span aria-hidden="true" class="mt-1 shrink-0 text-accent transition-transform duration-200 group-open:rotate-45"><svg class="h-5 w-5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" viewbox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 5v14M5 12h14"></path></svg></span></summary><p class="mt-3 max-w-3xl leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">Dogs and cats from 2.5kg upwards are fully supported today. Support for rabbits and other small companion animals is in development with our veterinary advisory panel.</p></details><details class="group px-6 py-5"><summary class="flex cursor-pointer list-none items-start justify-between gap-6 text-left font-display text-lg">How long before the system is useful?<span aria-hidden="true" class="mt-1 shrink-0 text-accent transition-transform duration-200 group-open:rotate-45"><svg class="h-5 w-5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" viewbox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 5v14M5 12h14"></path></svg></span></summary><p class="mt-3 max-w-3xl leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">Setup takes under thirty minutes. A fourteen-day baseline calibration follows, after which anomaly detection becomes accurate. Behavioural trigger correlation typically needs two to three weeks of observation.</p></details><details class="group px-6 py-5"><summary class="flex cursor-pointer list-none items-start justify-between gap-6 text-left font-display text-lg">What happens to my data?<span aria-hidden="true" class="mt-1 shrink-0 text-accent transition-transform duration-200 group-open:rotate-45"><svg class="h-5 w-5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" viewbox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 5v14M5 12h14"></path></svg></span></summary><p class="mt-3 max-w-3xl leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">It is encrypted in transit and at rest, stored under your account, and fully exportable or deletable at any time. We do not sell data to insurers, advertisers or data brokers. Household audio is classified on-device and never transmitted.</p></details><details class="group px-6 py-5"><summary class="flex cursor-pointer list-none items-start justify-between gap-6 text-left font-display text-lg">Do the devices work without internet?<span aria-hidden="true" class="mt-1 shrink-0 text-accent transition-transform duration-200 group-open:rotate-45"><svg class="h-5 w-5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" viewbox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 5v14M5 12h14"></path></svg></span></summary><p class="mt-3 max-w-3xl leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">Core functions continue offline. Feeding schedules, geofence alerts within range of your home hub and local data logging all operate normally, syncing once connectivity returns. Remote control and cellular tracking require a connection.</p></details></div><a class="mt-8 inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-sm font-semibold text-accent" href="<?php echo esc_url( home_url( '/faq/' ) ); ?>">Read the full FAQ <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></div></div></div></section><section class="py-20 sm:py-24 bg-secondary"><div class="container-page"><div class="grid gap-10 lg:grid-cols-2 lg:items-center"><div><h2 class="text-3xl leading-tight sm:text-4xl">The Pawlogic Brief</h2><p class="mt-4 text-lg leading-relaxed text-sage-foreground/80">One email a month. A summary of what our monitoring data showed, one practical piece of care guidance, and nothing else. Unsubscribe in a single click.</p></div><form class="flex flex-col gap-3 sm:flex-row"><label class="sr-only" for="newsletter-email">Email address</label><input autocomplete="email" class="w-full rounded-full border border-border bg-background px-6 py-3.5 text-sm outline-none placeholder:text-muted-foreground" id="newsletter-email" name="email" placeholder="you@example.com" required="" type="email"/><button class="shrink-0 rounded-full bg-primary px-7 py-3.5 text-sm font-semibold text-primary-foreground transition-transform duration-200 hover:-translate-y-0.5" type="submit">Subscribe</button><p class="text-sm text-sage-foreground" data-status="true" hidden="">Thank you. Please check your inbox to confirm.</p></form></div></div></section><section class="py-20 sm:py-24"><div class="container-page"><div class="relative overflow-hidden rounded-3xl bg-primary px-8 py-16 text-primary-foreground sm:px-14"><span aria-hidden="true" class="pointer-events-none absolute -right-24 -top-24 h-72 w-72 rounded-full bg-accent/25 blur-3xl"></span><div class="relative max-w-2xl"><h2 class="text-3xl leading-tight sm:text-4xl">Start with a conversation, not a shopping cart</h2><p class="mt-4 text-lg leading-relaxed text-primary-foreground/75">Tell us about your animals and your household. We will recommend the smallest configuration that genuinely solves your problem.</p><div class="mt-8 flex flex-wrap gap-3"><a class="inline-flex items-center rounded-full bg-accent px-6 py-3 text-sm font-semibold text-accent-foreground transition-transform duration-200 hover:-translate-y-0.5" hre